note Paths: the groups from Map::rows as folders with their path counts, red when a path under them is stale, then one row per path with kind, author tag, step count and its diff mark, red when it has stale steps. A group never clicked is open while it holds the path being read; a click records it open or closed in groups_open. The selected path expands into the outline underneath - one row per step, indented by depth, carrying the hierarchical number, the link as an arrow and a hidden count on a folded subtree. The row highlighted is the step the document currently has at the top, which is how the outline follows scrolling: when that step changes and its row is out of view, the outline scrolls it to the upper third, never while the scrollbar is being dragged.

